=== the coefficient read off the exact ratio (kram2's table)
    T_exact/T_asym - 1 = 0.9966/X + 2.015/X^2   (derived: 1/X exactly)
    deviation of the 1/X coefficient from 1: -0.34%

    1 + 1/X = sqrt(2) at X = 1/(sqrt(2)-1) = 2.4142
    the discarded fit window was X > 1.4, mean X ~ 2.4 -- so the
    'missing sqrt(2)' was 1 + 1/X evaluated at the X the simulation
    could afford.  There is no missing constant.
